T289	Quotation 144716 144892	"Besides, he could double up four men like you over his knee. Last year he helped our people to bring in the straw; he carried as many as six trusses at once, he is so strong."
T290	Entity 144669 144681	The landlady
R287	Speaker Arg1:T290 Arg2:T289	
T291	Quotation 144893 144901	"Bravo!"
T292	Cue 144902 144906	said
