T1201	Entity 268330 268332	He
T1202	Cue 268333 268342	declaimed
T1203	Quotation 268345 268700	"This is no longer the time, gentlemen, when civil discord ensanguined our public places, when the landlord, the business-man, the working-man himself, falling asleep at night, lying down to peaceful sleep, trembled lest he should be awakened suddenly by the noise of incendiary tocsins, when the most subversive doctrines audaciously sapped foundations."
R1318	Speaker Arg1:T1201 Arg2:T1203	
R1319	Cueing Arg1:T1202 Arg2:T1203	
T1204	Quotation 268701 268741	"Well, someone down there might see me,"
T1205	Entity 268742 268750	Rodolphe
T1206	Cue 268751 268758	resumed
T1207	Quotation 268760 268846	"then I should have to invent excuses for a fortnight; and with my bad reputation -- "
R1320	Speaker Arg1:T1205 Arg2:T1204	
R1321	Speaker Arg1:T1205 Arg2:T1207	
R1322	Cueing Arg1:T1206 Arg2:T1204	
R1323	Cueing Arg1:T1206 Arg2:T1207	
T1208	Quotation 268847 268881	"Oh, you are slandering yourself,"
T1209	Cue 268882 268886	said
T1210	Entity 268887 268891	Emma
R1324	Cueing Arg1:T1209 Arg2:T1208	
R1325	Speaker Arg1:T1210 Arg2:T1208	
T1211	Quotation 268893 268928	"No! It is dreadful, I assure you."
R1326	Cueing Arg1:T1209 Arg2:T1211	
R1327	Addressee Arg1:T1210 Arg2:T1211	
R1328	Addressee Arg1:T1210 Arg2:T1204	
R1329	Addressee Arg1:T1205 Arg2:T1208	
R1330	Speaker Arg1:T1205 Arg2:T1211	
R1331	Addressee Arg1:T1210 Arg2:T1207	
T1212	Quotation 268929 268946	"But, gentlemen,"
T1213	Cue 268947 268956	continued
T1214	Entity 268957 268971	the councillor
R1332	Cueing Arg1:T1213 Arg2:T1212	
R1333	Speaker Arg1:T1214 Arg2:T1212	
T1215	Quotation 268973 269497	"if, banishing from my memory the remembrance of these sad pictures, I carry my eyes back to the actual situation of our dear country, what do I see there? Everywhere commerce and the arts are flourishing; everywhere new means of communication, like so many new arteries in the body of the state, establish within it new relations. Our great industrial centres have recovered all their activity; religion, more consolidated, smiles in all hearts; our ports are full, confidence is born again, and France breathes once more!"
R1334	Cueing Arg1:T1213 Arg2:T1215	
R1335	Speaker Arg1:T1214 Arg2:T1215	
