T1226	Quotation 269620 269841	"Do you not know that there are souls constantly tormented? They need by turns to dream and to act, the purest passions and the most turbulent joys, and thus they fling themselves into all sorts of fantasies, of follies."
R1348	Speaker Arg1:T1221 Arg2:T1226	
R1349	Addressee Arg1:T1225 Arg2:T1226	
T1227	Entity 269847 269850	she
